<node id="chunk:fa995d28bf36">
  <data key="d0">policy_chunk</data>
  <data key="d9">Governance and Corporate Structure for an Insurance Company.docx</data>
  <data key="d10"></data>
  <data key="d11">Directors should be selected based on their industry experience, leadership capabilities, and understanding of regulatory landscapes. This ensures that the Board can effectively oversee the company’s strategic direction and compliance.</data>
</node>
