  <data key="d0">policy_chunk</data>
  <data key="d9">Governance and Corporate Structure for an Insurance Company.docx</data>
  <data key="d10"></data>
  <data key="d11">Ideally, an Independent Director should serve as the Chairperson to provide unbiased leadership and prevent conflicts of interest. The Chairperson plays a critical role in facilitating open discussions and ensuring that all voices are heard during Board meetings.</data>
</node>
