  <data key="d10">Risk Management &amp; Compliance Manual</data>
  <data key="d11">Internal Reporting: A robust reporting framework is established to provide timely and accurate information on stress testing and solvency assessments to the Risk Management Committee, Board, and senior management. This ensures that key stakeholders remain informed of the company's risk profile and f</data>
</node>
