  <data key="d0">policy_chunk</data>
  <data key="d9">Risk Management and Compliance for an Insurance Company.docx</data>
  <data key="d10">Risk Management &amp; Compliance Manual</data>
  <data key="d11">Internal Reporting: A robust reporting structure is established to provide timely and accurate information on risk and compliance activities to relevant stakeholders, including the Board, senior management, and regulators. This reporting supports informed decision-making and effective oversight.</data>
</node>
