  <data key="d10">Risk Management &amp; Compliance Manual</data>
  <data key="d11">Tools: The company uses a variety of tools, such as risk assessment matrices, heat maps, and scenario analyses, to evaluate the likelihood and impact of identified risks. These tools provide a comprehensive understanding of the company's risk exposure, allowing for informed decision-making.</data>
</node>
