  <data key="d0">policy_chunk</data>
  <data key="d9">Risk Management and Compliance for an Insurance Company.docx</data>
  <data key="d10">Risk Management &amp; Compliance Manual</data>
  <data key="d11">Technology Utilization: Technology is leveraged to enhance risk mitigation efforts, such as implementing automated controls and monitoring systems. These tools help reduce the likelihood of errors and fraud, improving the overall efficiency and effectiveness of risk management.</data>
</node>
