  <data key="d0">policy_chunk</data>
  <data key="d9">Underwriting and Risk Assessment.docx</data>
  <data key="d10">Underwriting &amp; Risk Assessment Policies and Procedures Manual</data>
  <data key="d11">Reducing Adverse Selection Risks: By classifying risks accurately, the company can reduce adverse selection, where only high-risk entities seek coverage, potentially leading to disproportionate losses.</data>
</node>
