  <data key="d0">policy_chunk</data>
  <data key="d9">Risk Management and Compliance for an Insurance Company.docx</data>
  <data key="d10">Risk Management &amp; Compliance Manual</data>
  <data key="d11">Compliance Monitoring: A compliance monitoring program is implemented to identify and address compliance risks. This program ensures that risks are managed proactively and effectively, supporting SecureLife's commitment to effective risk management.</data>
</node>
