  <data key="d0">policy_chunk</data>
  <data key="d9">Risk Management and Compliance for an Insurance Company.docx</data>
  <data key="d10">Risk Management &amp; Compliance Manual</data>
  <data key="d11">Documentation: The performance measurement process is documented, including the tools used, findings, and actions taken. This documentation promotes transparency and accountability, supporting SecureLife's commitment to effective risk management.</data>
</node>
