  <data key="d0">policy_chunk</data>
  <data key="d9">Risk Management and Compliance for an Insurance Company.docx</data>
  <data key="d10">Risk Management &amp; Compliance Manual</data>
  <data key="d11">Continuous Improvement: Feedback from stakeholders and lessons learned from risk events are used to continuously improve risk monitoring and reporting processes. This ensures the company remains responsive to changing risk environments and emerging challenges.</data>
</node>
