  <data key="d0">policy_chunk</data>
  <data key="d9">Governance and Corporate Structure for an Insurance Company.docx</data>
  <data key="d10"></data>
  <data key="d11">Focused on identifying, assessing, and managing risks across the organization, the committee regularly reviews risk exposure and mitigation measures. It ensures that risk policies are integrated into the company’s strategic planning.</data>
</node>
