  <data key="d10">Risk Management &amp; Compliance Manual</data>
  <data key="d11">Regulatory Reporting: Required solvency and capital adequacy reports are submitted to IRDAI in accordance with regulatory timelines and guidelines. SecureLife ensures that all reports are accurate and compliant with reporting standards to maintain regulatory credibility.</data>
</node>
