  <data key="d11">1.9 Phishing:
Phishing is a social engineering attack where attackers impersonate legitimate entities to trick individuals into providing sensitive information such as login credentials or financial data. Phishing can occur via email, phone, or other communication channels. The policy covers losses </data>
</node>
