  <data key="d0">policy_chunk</data>
  <data key="d9">Cyber Insurance Policy Document.docx</data>
  <data key="d10"></data>
  <data key="d11">10.4 Intellectual Property Rights:
Tech Solutions Ltd. must respect intellectual property rights and avoid unauthorized use of copyrighted materials, trademarks, or trade secrets. The Policyholder should conduct due diligence to ensure compliance with intellectual property laws and seek legal advice</data>
</node>
