  <data key="d10"></data>
  <data key="d11">9.1 Case Study 1: Ransomware Attack on Financial Systems
In this scenario, Tech Solutions Ltd. experiences a ransomware attack that encrypts critical financial data, rendering accounting systems inoperable. The Policyholder quickly engages cybersecurity experts to contain the spread of the malware a</data>
</node>
