  <data key="d9">Cyber Insurance Policy Document.docx</data>
  <data key="d10"></data>
  <data key="d11">5.3 Policy Cancellation:
Either party may cancel this policy with 30 days' written notice to the other party. In the event of cancellation, SecureNet Insurance Pvt. Ltd. will refund the unearned premium on a pro-rata basis, provided no claims have been made during the policy period. If a claim has b</data>
</node>
