Cyber Extortion coverage applies to payments made to prevent or terminate a cyber extortion threat, such as a ransomware demand. Coverage is contingent upon the Policyholder obtaining prior written approval from SecureNet Insurance Pvt. Ltd. before making any extortion payments.</data>
